]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000010a6:text","row":38389,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「え、どうやって？」","en":"“How did you do that?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903123","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00048","en":"Miki: \"Eh, but how'd you do it?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","presentation"],"assessment":"The dialogue line lacks its closing quotation mark.","remedy":"Miki: \"Eh, but how'd you do it?\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"Eh, but how'd you do it?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000010da:text","row":38390,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「風呂入ってる時間、小型冷蔵庫の急速モードで冷やした」","en":"“I put it in the mini-fridge on rapid-chill while we were bathing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903124","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00049","en":"Taichi: \"While we were in the bath, I chilled it with a small fridge's Rapid Mode.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000011ae:text","row":38391,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「ビー玉の入ったラムネだぁ」","en":"“Ramune—with a marble in it!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903125","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00050","en":"Miki: \"It's Ramune, the one with the marble!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000011ea:text","row":38392,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「田崎商店にて８０円」","en":"“Eighty yen from Tazaki's.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903126","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00051","en":"Taichi: \"80￥ at the Tasaki Store.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000123d:text","row":38393,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「きれー」","en":"“Pretty.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903127","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00052","en":"Miki: \"Purtyyy!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001267:text","row":38394,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「ビー玉を通して世界を見ると、きらきらと美しいのだ」","en":"“Look at the world through that marble and everything sparkles.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903128","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00053","en":"Taichi: \"If you look at the world through a marble, it's all beautiful, glittering and sparkling.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001339:text","row":38395,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「夏っぽいです」","en":"“It feels like summer.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903129","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00054","en":"Miki: \"It's so Summerlike.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001369:text","row":38396,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「うむ」","en":"“Indeed.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903130","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00055","en":"Taichi: \"Yup.\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001389:text","row":38397,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"二人でラムネを飲んだ。","en":"We drank our ramune together.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903131","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00056","en":"We drank Ramune, the two of us.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000143d:text","row":38398,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「きれいになったし、ラムネもゴチになったし、そんじゃそろそろ行きますかねー」","en":"“I'm clean, you treated me to ramune... Guess it's about time I headed out.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903132","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00057","en":"Miki: \"Got made all clean and pretty, got treated to Ramune, so then it's about time we go isn't iiit?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000014a9:text","row":38399,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺も部活に行こうっと」","en":"“I think I'll go to the club too.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903133","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00058","en":"Taichi: \"I also want to go to Club.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["tense_aspect"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000155f:text","row":38400,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「……本当に部活に行くんですね」","en":"“...You're really going to the club?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903134","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00059","en":"Miki: \"...you are seriously going to club, then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000159f:text","row":38401,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「準備はできてるし」","en":"“The preparations are done.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903135","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00060","en":"Taichi: \"All preparations are made.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000015d3:text","row":38402,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「あの折れたアンテナでも、届かないことはないだろう」","en":"“Even with the antenna broken, the signal ought to reach somebody.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903136","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00061","en":"Taichi: \"I don't think even with that broken antenna I'll have problems reaching someone.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000016a5:text","row":38403,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「あの」","en":"“Um...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903137","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00062","en":"Miki: \"Uhm.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000016ea:text","row":38404,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「一緒に、同じ時間を生きませんか？」","en":"“Won't you live through the same time as me?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903138","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00063","en":"Miki: \"Couldn't we live in the same time, together?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001726:text","row":38405,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"問いかける瞳。","en":"Her eyes searched mine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903139","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00064","en":"In the eyes that ask that question,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000174c:text","row":38406,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"真剣に。","en":"Completely serious.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903140","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00065","en":"there's seriousness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001774:text","row":38407,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ありがたいけど」","en":"“...Thank you, but...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903141","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00066","en":"Taichi: \"...I'm thankful, but...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001828:text","row":38408,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903142","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00067","en":"Miki: \"So you are.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The response means 'I see' or resigned acknowledgment, not an assertion about what the addressee is.","remedy":"I see.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":18,"start":7,"text":"So you are."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001856:text","row":38409,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「忘れたいんだよ。なんか後味あまり良くないし」","en":"“I want to forget. This week left a bad taste in my mouth.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903143","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00068","en":"Taichi: \"I want to forget, really. The aftertaste of all this isn't really good.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001922:text","row":38410,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「……毎週、先輩を見てきました」","en":"“...I've watched you week after week.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903144","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00069","en":"Miki: \"...I've been looking at you, Senpai, every week.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:0000197f:text","row":38411,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「それぞれの先輩は、同一人物じゃないんですよ？」","en":"“None of those Taichis was the same person, you know?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903145","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00070","en":"Miki: \"Ever one of you, Senpai is... not the exact same person, you know?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","grammar"],"assessment":"The English contains a typo and a broken agreement structure that obscures the reference to each weekly version of him.","remedy":"Every version of you, Senpai, is","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":7,"text":"Ever one of you, Senpai is"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:000019cf:text","row":38412,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうなるね」","en":"“I guess not.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903146","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00071","en":"Taichi: \"That's how it is then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001a7b:text","row":38413,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"「今生きて、話してるわたしたちは、今一度きりの自分なんです」","en":"“The two of us here, alive and talking... these selves exist only once.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903147","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00072","en":"Miki: \"The two of us here living and talking, right now, are one-time-only selves.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001ad7:text","row":38414,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも美希。忘れてる」","en":"“But you're forgetting something, Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903148","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00073","en":"Taichi: \"But Miki. You forget.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001b0d:text","row":38415,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺の理性は、すごく薄くて破れやすいものなんだ」","en":"“My reason is very thin. It tears easily.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903149","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00074","en":"Taichi: \"My rationality is a very thin thing, and easily torn apart.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001bdb:text","row":38416,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……」","en":"“Ah...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903150","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00075","en":"Miki: \"Ah...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001c05:text","row":38417,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「いつも一緒にいたら、美希が危ないよ」","en":"“If we stayed together all the time, you'd be in danger.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903151","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00076","en":"Taichi: \"If we were always together, it would be a danger for you, Miki!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001c4b:text","row":38418,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希はすごく可愛いから、つい力が入ってしまうかも知れないし」","en":"“You're so cute I might get carried away and use too much force.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903152","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00077","en":"Taichi: \"Miki, you're incredibly cute, so it might be that I will accidentally use too much force or something.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001ca1:text","row":38419,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"頭を撫でる。","en":"I stroked her head.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903153","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00078","en":"I stroke her head.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001cea:text","row":38420,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ままなりませんね」","en":"“...Things never go the way you want, do they?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903154","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00079","en":"Miki: \"...this is not going to work, no.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001d22:text","row":38421,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういうものだよ」","en":"“That's how it is.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903155","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00080","en":"Taichi: \"That is how this goes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001d56:text","row":38422,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ甘えたかったら、いつでもその時々の黒須太一を頼ってくれ」","en":"“Still, if you ever need someone to lean on, ask whichever Taichi Kurosu happens to exist that week.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903156","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00081","en":"Taichi: \"Well, if you want to be fawned on, you can always depend on the occasional Kurosu Taichi!\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001db4:text","row":38423,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903157","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00082","en":"Miki: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001dd8:text","row":38424,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"返事はなかった。","en":"She gave no answer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903158","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00083","en":"There was no reply.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0282:00001e08:text","row":38425,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ、行くか」","en":"“All right. Let's go.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:903159","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4023:00084","en":"Taichi: \"So, do we go?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
